Package: BvCh
Type: Package
Title: Bivariate Chen Distribution: Density, Survival, Hazard, Plots and
        Estimates
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Mukul", "Bijalwan", role = "aut",
           comment = "Orchid ID: https://orcid.org/0009-0001-3040-6912"),
    person(given = "Puneet Kumar", family = "Gupta",
           email = "puneetstat999@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Probability density, survival and hazard functions, random
    generation, graphical displays and maximum likelihood estimation for
    bivariate Chen type models. Three constructions are covered: the
    Marshall-Olkin type Bivariate Chen distribution with a singular component
    on the diagonal, the Bivariate Extended Chen distribution, and the
    Bivariate Inverse FGM Chen distribution obtained through the Inverse FGM
    copula with Chen marginals. Univariate Chen density, distribution,
    quantile, survival, hazard and random generation routines are obtained
    from the 'reliaR' package.
